+On Metal the same `--drafter` also takes a dense Qwen3.5 checkpoint's MTP head: a directory whose config declares one
+MTP layer and holds `mtp.safetensors` (the head's 15 BF16 tensors) or the BF16 shards. Only `mtp.*` loads, quantized
+to affine-4 at load; the head drafts a chain over the target's last layer that stops below a chain probability of
